<Layouts.app flash={@flash} current_scope={@current_scope}>
  <article id="terms" class="max-w-[68ch]">
    <h1 class="type-h1">Terms of Sale</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">
      For prints bought from Jan Johnson, Old Master &amp; Modern Prints Inc.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="type-h2">Authenticity</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Every print is guaranteed authentic and as described. We take great care to describe each
        print accurately, including its condition. If, when your purchase arrives, you can show that
        a print is not as described, we will refund your payment in full.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="type-h2">Prints on approval</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        We are happy to send prints on approval to clients we know, or who can give us references.
        You then have ten days from receiving a print to decide.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="type-h2">Packing and shipping</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Packing and shipping are charged in addition to the price of the print. Packages are usually
        sent by Federal Express.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="type-h2">Payment</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        We accept cheques or bank drafts in US dollars, and wire transfers. We expect to begin
        accepting credit cards during 2026.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="type-h2">Canadian clients</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Prices can be converted to Canadian dollars for immediate payment. HST, or GST and provincial
        sales tax, will be added.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="mt-12 border-t border-rule pt-6">
      Questions about a purchase? <.link href={~p"/contact"} class="link">Contact us</.link>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layouts.app>
